  "title": "Espetinho de Queijo Coalho Com Abacaxi (Brazilian Grilled Cheese with Pineapple)",
  "description": "In this easy Brazilian recipe, queijo coalho (cheese rennet) and pineapple are tossed in brown sugar and grilled then skewered with mint.",
